   "text": "MacEwan University (Undergraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nMacEwan University (Undergraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFounded in 1971, MacEwan University inspires students with a powerful combination of academic excellence and personal learning experiences. Through learner-centred teaching, we connect with our students—creating a unique post-secondary experience that opens up diverse pathways for achievement and growth.The university provides a transformative education in a collaborative and supportive learning environment. Creativity thrives here—through research and innovation that engages students, faculty and the community. We are focused on our students—providing them with choice and opportunities for success with a dynamic mix of undergraduate degrees, certificates, diplomas and degree-transfer programming.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:30\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:30\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$30,000.00\nMin: CA$19,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n5%\n950 of 19,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1971\nCampus(es)\nEdmonton\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/10/2023\nContract End Date\n31/10/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.macewan.ca/campus-life/residence/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.macewan.ca/apply-enrol/fees-finances/scholarships-awards-bursaries/entrance-scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e0lzJZXbnbE\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.macewan.ca/academics/careers-experience/experiential-learning/\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - CAD $ 110",
